[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STP-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS requires comprehensive testing for safety-critical, real-time, and secure military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for test planning.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STP-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers test scope, referenced documents, test preparations, test descriptions, and requirements traceability per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports test execution and validation.

